      "name": "PAU Punjab laboratory report interpretation · Rabi 2025–26",
      "states": [
        "Punjab"
      ],
      "source": "Punjab Agricultural University · Package of Practices for Crops of Punjab, Rabi 2025–26, printed pp. 106–108",
      "url": "https://www.pau.edu/content/ccil/pf/pp_rabi.pdf",
      "methodRequirement": "The publication does not specify extraction methods here. Apply only to a laboratory report whose issuing lab confirms this PAU interpretation applies to its methods; never assume equivalence for Olsen, Bray, Mehlich or total nutrient tests.",
