      "scope": "Regional publication; analytical method mapping not established",
      "classificationEnabled": false,
      "rules": [],
      "reviewNote": "Retained for history and source lookup. Arbitrary method text or a confirmation checkbox cannot establish analytical equivalence. New automated classification is disabled until a source validates the methods."
